  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Modern Conflict: Rearmed</strong></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br>本模組將現代戰爭帶入 Minecraft，兼具風格、精準度與真實感。您將發現全動畫 3D 槍械、深度自訂設定，以及沉浸式機制&mdash;所有設計皆旨在提升您的戰鬥體驗。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>!!!注意!!!</strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">執行此模組需安裝 PointBlank:Jelly，已不再支援 Vic&rsquo;s Point Blank。若要使用 Vic&rsquo;s Point Blank，請前往<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/modern-conflict-rearmed/files/6824939\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>下載 1.0.0 之前的舊版。</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9f11aeb6-1de4-45f4-b514-535a69da4953.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">截至 2025 年 11 月 1 日，Modern Conflict: Rearmed 約包含 150 種槍枝與 380 款共用及獨有配件。</h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>安裝步驟：</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下載並將&nbsp;<strong>mcr-1.0.0.jar</strong> 檔案放入 <strong>.minecraft/mods</strong> 資料夾中</li>\n<li>下載所有必要相依模組：<strong>PointBlank:Jelly</strong>、<strong>GeckoLib</strong> 與 <strong>playerAnimator</strong>，並將其放入 <strong>.minecraft/mods</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎加入我們的 <strong>Discord 伺服器</strong>，我們將定期舉辦<strong>活動</strong>！此外還能找到更多&nbsp;<strong>預覽資訊</strong>、<strong>圖片</strong>以及<strong>友善的社群</strong>：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/XqGgvWvV4s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/XqGgvWvV4s</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>致謝：</strong></h2>\n<p>音效來源：Vic&rsquo;s Modern Warfare / Modern Warfare Cubed 與 Activision (MW)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>全部槍枝圖示（截至 2025 年 11 月 1 日）：</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1407291118235811901/1434222846120558762/image.png?ex=69078b9d&is=69063a1d&hm=d9a6e8e6a9e4db39a863f41119385b65f41e3eb05b786a76ecfc854c28676fb5&\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1407291118235811901/1434222918287753487/image.png?ex=69078bae&is=69063a2e&hm=380092e5d19401aa248f9f733c3211cc1d8e130ac794447a877a5a966f19b3e5&\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1407291118235811901/1434222961459462264/image.png?ex=69078bb8&is=69063a38&hm=d4d23f8620425309ca2bef0f2b231713e678102877b5a1f65bc6765a54fe8011&\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1407291118235811901/1434223009954136235/image.png?ex=69078bc4&is=69063a44&hm=f8fa2f2a5c3ba9e85a1ea7ec9f24c06e8228029c2a6fcfee5ac8de71e6e2d1b9&\"></strong></p>",
